          %h4#AdjustedWeilAlgebras Adjusted Weil algebras
          %p
            For some purposes of
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/schreiber/show/L-infinity+algebra+connections"}
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}>
