            of an
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/L-%E2%88%9E+algebra"} L-∞ algebra
            has in degree 0 the ground field, that of an
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/L-%E2%88%9E+algebroid"} L-∞ algebroid
            has more generally an
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/algebra+over+a+Lawvere+theory"} algebra over
            a
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Lawvere+theory"} Lawvere theory
            = succeed "s" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/L-%E2%88%9E+algebroid"} L-∞ algebroid
            = succeed "s" do
